amic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/18/8d/4c/a5/caption.jpg", "contribution_count": 20, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 1203011, "location_name": "Butwal", "location_name_detailed": "Butwal, Nepal"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2018-04-23", "published_at_date": "2018-04-23"}, {"review_id": 575179496, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r575179496-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Busy holy place", "text": "Organised visit.  You have to be a hindu to enter the temple itself.  Lots of history.  There is a cremation place which one can go and see the cremations (if any) taking place. Its a personal choice one that I avoided.  Just be careful of anyone promising you \"vip\" type access and \"vip\" prayers. There isn't such. You all just queue up.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "friends", "stay_date": "2018-04-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "02B581EB0E0B1627722FF9A92EEDABD4", "name": "Peekmeister", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Peekmeister", "username": "Peekmeister", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-f/01/2e/70/63/avatar041.jpg", "contribution_count": 77, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 186338, "location_name": "London", "location_name_detailed": "London, United Kingdom"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2018-04-23", "published_at_date": "2018-04-23"}, {"review_id": 575170086, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r575170086-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Amazing place", "text": "We went on a religious day which is to be avoided. Very busy and one does get pushed along with the crowd which was 